      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Have seen the suggestion in various places to change consumables into a charge/daily limit system which I agree with 100%. 5 uses for the lifetime of a paid item is wildly predatory.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
