      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also oppose the implementation of consumables.\n\nEven in Japanese yen, each one costs about 130 yen, and you can only use them five times...\n\nIf there's no movement toward improvement, I think protest activities would be an effective strategy.\n\nI hope they take appropriate action before it comes to that.\n\n(If protest activities happen in VRChat, it'll probably go down in VRC history lol)\n\nAlso, regarding another item:\n\nThe Vket Photo Frame is being sold in a way that could easily mislead buyers.\n\nWith that appearance, I personally would have been fooled into thinking it was a camera skin.\n\nLuckily, I caught it before buying, but it seems some people already purchased it thinking it was a camera skin.\n\nThis issue might also be the fault of HIKKY, the organizer of Vket.\n\nThis matter is off-topic for this thread, so I believe a separate improvement request should be submitted. Sorry",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
